.claude/worktrees/
# Agentic user pilot evidence: screenshots, auth session, findings, reports.
# Contains a live Supabase session — must never be committed.
.pilot/
# The same evidence as it is laid out on the `pilot-evidence/pr-<n>` branches.
# An agent fetching that branch to read the captures lands these at the repo
# root, where `git add -A` will happily stage a few hundred PNGs of a live
# session onto the feature branch (near-miss, 2026-08-03). Root-anchored so a
# legitimately-named file deeper in the tree is unaffected.
/screens/
/findings.jsonl
/interactions.jsonl
/summary.md
# Playwright's own report tree, which the same checkout also drops at the root.
# Missing from the 2026-08-03 list, so it staged ~300 more files on 2026-08-05.
/output/
# WARNING — ignoring is not enough. That branch carries its own README.md, so
# checking it out at the repo root OVERWRITES the tracked one (happened
# 2026-08-05, caught before the commit). .gitignore cannot protect a tracked
# file: after reading pilot evidence, run `git restore README.md` and check
# `git status` for tracked modifications before committing anything.
playwright-report/
test-results/
